{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2022-12-07 10:00:00', 'title': 'KETCHUM NAMED GLOBAL NETWORK OF THE YEAR AT ICCO GLOBAL AWARDS 2022', 'text': "CONSULTANCY WINS BIG WITH TOP AGENCY HONOR AND FOUR TOTAL ACCOLADES AT CEREMONY CELEBRATING PR CAMPAIGNS, INDIVIDUALS AND ORGANIZATIONS FROM AROUND THE WORLD KETCHUM'S\xa0JO-ANN ROBERTSON ACKNOWLEDGED AS PR LEADER OF THE YEAR NEW YORK , DEC. 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LEADING GLOBAL COMMUNICATIONS CONSULTANCY KETCHUM\xa0WAS RECENTLY NAMED GLOBAL NETWORK OF THE YEAR AT THE ICCO GLOBAL AWARDS 2022 CEREMONY. THE AGENCY WAS HONORED WITH FOUR ESTEEMED ACCOLADES DURING THE EVENT."}